1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:07,173
This is Odile. In March, she's leading 35 of us to Strasbourg.
And honestly? She's a little nervous.

2
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:10,150
So she starts with the nest.

3
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:13,286
Passport? Check! Packing list? Check!

4
00:00:13,350 --> 00:00:14,823
One to-do at a time.

5
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:20,791
Next, she maps the trip. Every day, every tram,
every meeting spot, right in your pocket.

6
00:00:21,250 --> 00:00:25,935
Tickets, forms, insurance.
Every document, tucked safely in the nest.

7
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:29,700
Then, a few minutes a day. French... Bonjour !

8
00:00:29,750 --> 00:00:33,942
...scripture memory, and culture, with streaks
that keep the whole team going.

9
00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:39,239
By March, we won't just be packed.
We'll be ready. Together.

10
00:00:40,800 --> 00:00:42,754
Le Nid. On y va !
